{"id":"c82e036702142487","group":"20","path":"20/20-cor-hif-downward.md","title":"超免疫自由度向下封闭","display":"cor-hif-downward — 超免疫自由度向下封闭","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-cor-hif-downward","aliases":["20-cor-hif-downward"],"display":"cor-hif-downward — 超免疫自由度向下封闭","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 5.6.2；Corollary 5.6.3","source_printed_pages":[124,125],"source_pdf_pages":[159,160],"depends_on":["[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","[[20-thm-turing-preorder]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-cor-hif-downward"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-cor-hif-downward</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-hif-downward — 超免疫自由度向下封闭"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 5.6.2；Corollary 5.6.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span><span>125</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>159</span><span>160</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cb7ab804f482ad4e\" href=\"?note=cb7ab804f482ad4e\" title=\"20-thm-turing-preorder\">20-thm-turing-preorder</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\le_T A\">\\(B\\le_T A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\">\\(\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" href=\"?note=7e2e8a3b26e3283a\" title=\"20-df-hyperimmune-free\">20-df-hyperimmune-free</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cb7ab804f482ad4e\" href=\"?note=cb7ab804f482ad4e\" title=\"20-thm-turing-preorder\">20-thm-turing-preorder</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hif-downward}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hif-downward}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>任何全 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 可计算函数经 oracle 复合也是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 可计算，故分别有普通可计算支配函数。该论证不要求统一获得支配函数的索引。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.6.2；Corollary 5.6.3；印刷页 124, 125；PDF 第 159, 160 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-turing-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"cb7ab804f482ad4e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-turing-preorder]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-hyperimmune-free","status":"resolved","id":"7e2e8a3b26e3283a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-turing-preorder]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-turing-preorder","status":"resolved","id":"cb7ab804f482ad4e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-hyperimmune-free]]；see [[20-thm-turing-preorder]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"B\\le_T A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(A))","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\omega)\\cup2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}hif-downward}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HIF}(\\deg_T(B)).","display":true},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1147,"backlinks":[{"id":"c9d3b071b7008d27","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-thm-delta2-hyperimmune]]；see [[20-cor-hif-downward]]；see [[20-thm-K-undecidable]]；see [[20-df-jump]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-cor-hif-downward]] — 章 5；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-cor-hif-downward]]"}],"outgoing":["7e2e8a3b26e3283a","cb7ab804f482ad4e"]}